{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:38a01513f532d9ed","name":"Collisions","source":{"id":"source:reference-38a01513f532d9ed","title":"Collisions","revision":18043,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T19:29:45Z","sha256":"8a55f0639b2c02885ec42689b353b8f2d75982af9eecb9a6f6a7bcb338fa832c","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18043","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Collisions&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-38a01513f532d9ed","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Collision occurs whenever your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," moves into a space occupied by a another ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"},", creature, structure, or hazard (such as an asteroid), or whenever such things move into your Vehicle's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fighting Space"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fighting_Space","referenceId":"reference:cdbf34043baceb78"},". A Collision is treated as an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Area Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Area_Attack"},". You can reduce or negate the damage from a Collision as a Reaction by succeeding at a DC 15 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pilot","referenceId":"reference:383e2d946278a872"}," check (see Avoid Collision, below). Unless the Vehicle provides no ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cover"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cover"}," to those onboard, any damage dealt to passengers and crew in a Collision is reduced by an amount equal to the Vehicle's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Threshold"},". Additionally, Collision damage is doubled if the colliding Vehicle is using the ",{"tag":"a","children":["All-Out Movement"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/All-Out_Movement","referenceId":"reference:c3e269326f94373b"}," Action.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Ramming Vehicles:"]}," When the source of the Collision is a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ramming"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ramming"}," Vehicle, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Pilot","referenceId":"reference:4aff6d0e54fff36e"}," of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ramming"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ramming"}," Vehicle makes a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pilot","referenceId":"reference:383e2d946278a872"}," check (instead of an attack roll), and compares the result to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," of the target. If the check succeeds, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ramming"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ramming"}," Vehicle, the target, and all passengers aboard ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicles"}," involved in the Collision take the amount of damage listed in the Collision Damage table, below. If the check fails, reduce the damage by half.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Mobile Hazards:"]}," When the source of the Collision is a mobile hazard of Large size or greater (such as an asteroid, or unguided ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"},"), the colliding hazard makes an attack roll against the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},". If the attack hits, the colliding hazard, the target, and all passengers aboard ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicles"}," involved in the Collision take the amount of damage listed in the Collision Damage table, above. If the attack fails, reduce the damage by half. The hazard's attack roll is resolved by rolling 1d20 and adding a flat modifier based on its size:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":["Large, +1;"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Huge, +2;"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Gargantuan, +5;"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Colossal or bigger, +10."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"caption","children":["Collision Damage\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SIZE OF COLLIDING OBJECT\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["DAMAGE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["\n"],"rowspan":5},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SIZE OF COLLIDING OBJECT\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["DAMAGE\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Colossal (Station)\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["20d6 + ",{"tag":"a","children":["Strength"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Strength"}," Modifier\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Gargantuan\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["6d6 + ",{"tag":"a","children":["Strength"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Strength"}," Modifier\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Colossal (Cruiser)\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["15d6 + ",{"tag":"a","children":["Strength"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Strength"}," Modifier\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Huge\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["4d6 + ",{"tag":"a","children":["Strength"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Strength"}," Modifier\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Colossal (Frigate)\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["10d6 + ",{"tag":"a","children":["Strength"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Strength"}," Modifier\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Large\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["2d6 + ",{"tag":"a","children":["Strength"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Strength"}," Modifier\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Colossal\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["8d6 + ",{"tag":"a","children":["Strength"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Strength"}," Modifier\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["\n"],"colspan":2}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Avoid Collision"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Any time your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," is subject to a Collision, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Pilot","referenceId":"reference:4aff6d0e54fff36e"}," can make a DC 15 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pilot","referenceId":"reference:383e2d946278a872"}," check as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"},". If you succeed on the check, all targets involved in the Collision take half damage. You can't attempt to Avoid Collision when you intentionally ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ram"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ram","referenceId":"reference:76e11af94d353c6e"}," a target, or when using ",{"tag":"a","children":["All-Out Movement"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/All-Out_Movement","referenceId":"reference:c3e269326f94373b"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Starship Scale:"]}," Collisions are easier to avoid at ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship Scale"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship_Scale"},". If you succeed on the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pilot","referenceId":"reference:383e2d946278a872"}," check to Avoid Collision in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship Scale"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship_Scale"},", no Collision occurs.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
